# Content design

Write for someone who wants to understand or control their home quickly. Use words a household already uses, say what will happen and say what the home is doing now.

This page is a summary. The [writing guide](../content/index.html) owns the full rules. Where the two differ, follow the guide.

## Examples

These examples use invented household details. They are simulations: the buttons do not control a home. Open an example to see it at full width or to read its HTML.

